scussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This method is called after an annotation is selected, before any callout is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"displayed for the annotation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If the return value is ","type":"text"},{"code":"YES","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", a callout view is shown when the user taps on an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"annotation, selecting it. The default callout displays the annotation’s title","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and subtitle. You can add accessory views to either end of the callout by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"implementing the ","type":"text"},{"code":"-mapView:leftCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"-mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" methods. You can further","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"customize the callout’s contents by implementing the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-mapView:calloutViewForAnnotation:"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the return value is "},{"code":"NO","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or if this method is absent from the delegate, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if the annotation lacks a title, the annotation will not show a callout even"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when selected."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":4,"text":"Related examples","anchor":"Related-examples"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Add annotation views and images"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Display custom views as callouts"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TODO: Default callout usage, learn how 